    {
      "label": "Description",
      "value": [
        "You point toward a creature within range and whisper a message. The target (and only the target) hears the message and can reply in a whisper that only you can hear.",
        "You can cast this spell through solid objects if you are familiar with the target and know it is beyond the barrier. Magical silence; 1 foot of stone, metal, or wood; or a thin sheet of lead blocks the spell.",
        "* - (a copper wire)"
      ],
      "html": "<div> <p>You point toward a creature within range and whisper a message. The target (and only the target) hears the message and can reply in a whisper that only you can hear.</p> <p>You can cast this spell through solid objects if you are familiar with the target and know it is beyond the barrier. Magical silence; 1 foot of stone, metal, or wood; or a thin sheet of lead blocks the spell.</p> <span>* - (a copper wire)</span> </div>",
